# Kame Apply: agent context

## Read first (task-scoped)

1. `docs/README.md` → **`docs/prd.md`** (authoritative scope, principles P1–P7) and **`docs/tech-stack.md`** (authoritative stack)
2. **`docs/phases/README.md`**: the build plan; read the current phase file before starting work
3. `docs/architecture/overview.md`: system diagram, invariants, modules, workflows
4. `docs/research/*`: background per area (site access 02, apply engine 03, safety 04, resumes 05, workflow 06, recruiters 07, bring-your-own-Claude 08)
5. `docs/design/design-system.md` + `ux-blueprint.md` before any UI work
6. Per-page behavior → `docs/guides/routes/README.md` (created when the first page ships)

## Stack (see `docs/tech-stack.md`)

- **Monorepo:** pnpm workspaces + Turborepo (TS) and a uv workspace (Python): `apps/{web,api,runner,extension}`, `packages/{ui,api-client,py-core}`
- **Web (`apps/web`):** Vue 3 + Nuxt 4 (SPA), Tailwind v4, Reka UI, Vue Query, Pinia (UI state only), VeeValidate + Zod, Phosphor icons. UI only.
- **Backend (`apps/api`):** FastAPI + Pydantic v2, SQLAlchemy 2 async + Alembic, **DBOS** durable workflows, PydanticAI. Owns all business logic.
- **DB:** PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector + pg_trgm + RLS. No Redis.
- **Runner / extension:** Playwright (Python) in `apps/runner`; WXT + Vue in `apps/extension`.
- **Files:** Cloudflare R2 (MinIO locally), short-lived signed URLs.
- **Auth:** FastAPI JWT access + refresh, Google OAuth, argon2. Workspace roles `owner | admin | member | viewer`.

Out of scope here (see `tech-stack.md` §6): React/Next/TanStack Start/shadcn/Lucide, Supabase, Prisma/Drizzle, tRPC, Redis/ARQ, and any anti-detection tooling.

