## Where to edit (fill in as each phase lands real paths)

| Concern | Path |
| --- | --- |
| API modules | `apps/api/app/<module>/{router,service,models,schemas,workflows}.py` |
| DB schema | `apps/api/app/**/models.py` + `apps/api/migrations/versions/` |
| Source / ATS adapters | `packages/py-core/…` and `apps/api/app/sources/` |
| AI features | `apps/api/app/ai/` (prompt registry, router, budgets, evals) |
| Web UI | `apps/web/`, shared components in `packages/ui/` |
| Extension | `apps/extension/` |

